<title>UK: Citibank says ups UK base rate to 6.25 pct.</title>
<headline>Citibank says ups UK base rate to 6.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank, part of Citicorp, said on Monday it had raised its UK bank base rate by 25 basis points to 6.25 percent.  </p>
<p>The bank said the base rate rise was effective immediately.</p>
<p>Citibank's move follows the decision by Britain's new Labour government to increase interest rates to 6.25 percent from 6.00 percent.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4365</p>
